  ('special', '{"ko":"Double Lariat","en":"Double Lariat"}'::jsonb, 'PP', '1400', '15', '2, 2, 2, 2', '27', 'Knockdown +27...56', '-41...-12', '{"ko":"판정: 상단\nProjectile invincible on frames 6-45. Anti-air invincible on frames 6-16. Hold forward or back to move during the attack, can continue adjusting direction as long as the attack is active. First hit connects with crouching opponents, all followup hits whiff on crouching opponents.","en":"Hit level: High\nProjectile invincible on frames 6-45. Anti-air invincible on frames 6-16. Hold forward or back to move during the attack, can continue adjusting direction as long as the attack is active. First hit connects with crouching opponents, all followup hits whiff on crouching opponents."}'::jsonb, 28),
