  ('super', '{"ko":"Cyclone Lariat (Level 2)","en":"Cyclone Lariat (Level 2)"}'::jsonb, '236236P', '3160 (3060) / 1100', '18', '**', '52 / 25', 'Knockdown +5 / Knockdown +87 / ** / **', '-35', '{"ko":"Fully invincible on frames 1-18. Breaks armor. Projectile invincible on frames 19-119. If no direction is pressed, Zangief will do 3160 damage and side swap after he body slams the opponent. Holding a direction will chose that direction and prevent the sideswap, but only do 3060 damage. Holding Punch causes a Limited Juggle State rather than the body slam, which does 1100 damage.","en":"Fully invincible on frames 1-18. Breaks armor. Projectile invincible on frames 19-119. If no direction is pressed, Zangief will do 3160 damage and side swap after he body slams the opponent. Holding a direction will chose that direction and prevent the sideswap, but only do 3060 damage. Holding Punch causes a Limited Juggle State rather than the body slam, which does 1100 damage."}'::jsonb, 40),
