  ('special', '{"ko":"Tenshin","en":"Tenshin"}'::jsonb, '63214K', '0 (682)', '8', '2', '52', '+8 (Knockdown +86)', null, '{"ko":"판정: 잡기\nRequires 3 Drinks to use. A command grab that gives a free followup attack. Attack strength does not change data. Waiting after an Overdrive hit causes a delayed crumple into Limited Juggle State. Overdrive data in parenthesis.","en":"Hit level: Throw\nRequires 3 Drinks to use. A command grab that gives a free followup attack. Attack strength does not change data. Waiting after an Overdrive hit causes a delayed crumple into Limited Juggle State. Overdrive data in parenthesis."}'::jsonb, 47),
