  ('special', '{"ko":"Hidden Variable","en":"Hidden Variable"}'::jsonb, '214P', null, '19', null, '(7) 17 (14 + 3 Landing)', null, null, '{"ko":"Full invincibility on frames 19-26. Can cancel recovery into an attack after 7 frames, full recovery is 17 without a cancel. Overdrive version has same cancel after 7 frames of recovery, but for jump attacks. Full overdrive recovery is 14+3 Landing. As of August 2026 patch: holding the button makes the teleport stay in-place (a feint).","en":"Full invincibility on frames 19-26. Can cancel recovery into an attack after 7 frames, full recovery is 17 without a cancel. Overdrive version has same cancel after 7 frames of recovery, but for jump attacks. Full overdrive recovery is 14+3 Landing. As of August 2026 patch: holding the button makes the teleport stay in-place (a feint)."}'::jsonb, 46),
