  ('unique', '{"ko":"Front Flip (Side Flip > KK)","en":"Front Flip (Side Flip > KK)"}'::jsonb, 'Side Flip > KK', null, null, null, null, null, null, '{"ko":"Rashid will Jump after the side flip. Can control range with Back+KK (shortest), KK (middle), or Forward+KK (farthest), this direction obeys Rashid''s original starting position, so if he crosses the opponent up the Front Flip direction affect distance as they would have before he crossed them up. Can perform any Jump attack out of the Front Flip.","en":"Rashid will Jump after the side flip. Can control range with Back+KK (shortest), KK (middle), or Forward+KK (farthest), this direction obeys Rashid''s original starting position, so if he crosses the opponent up the Front Flip direction affect distance as they would have before he crossed them up. Can perform any Jump attack out of the Front Flip."}'::jsonb, 19),
