  ('normal', '{"ko":"Forward Jump, Down + Heavy Punch (Blitz Strike)","en":"Forward Jump, Down + Heavy Punch (Blitz Strike)"}'::jsonb, 'Blitz Strike', '850', '10', '5', '3 Landing', '**-8...**-1', '**-28...**-21', '{"ko":"판정: 중단\nJumps off the opponent''s head on hit or on block, which then allows Rashid to perform any Jump attack after. The in-game frame meter''s hit/block data assumes Rashid empty lands, so on-hit, he''s actually incredibly advantaged in terms of when he can act. So much so that, in the corner where he doesn''t travel away due to hitting the wall, on-hit he can combo Blitz Strike into every jumping attack from even the earliest Blitz Strike hit. On-block in the corner, he''s around -9...-12. Forced knockdown on air hit.","en":"Hit level: Overhead\nJumps off the opponent''s head on hit or on block, which then allows Rashid to perform any Jump attack after. The in-game frame meter''s hit/block data assumes Rashid empty lands, so on-hit, he''s actually incredibly advantaged in terms of when he can act. So much so that, in the corner where he doesn''t travel away due to hitting the wall, on-hit he can combo Blitz Strike into every jumping attack from even the earliest Blitz Strike hit. On-block in the corner, he''s around -9...-12. Forced knockdown on air hit."}'::jsonb, 28),
